3     A bounded factory comparison
The resource-count question is different from the entropy question. We compare preparing and
purifying the whole six-qudit phase with purifying independent single-qudit primitives and then
compiling it. This is the synthillation strategy of Campbell–Howard [16]; Li–Yeh [17, Section 4.4
and Appendix C.1] already connects signed physical qutrit gates to a coupled logical resource and
its distillation. Our claim is the following finite, same-target comparison.

